    <!-- Story Card -->
    <article class="content-card">
      <div class="card-icon-title">
        <span class="card-icon">🎬</span>
        <h2 class="card-title">Our Story &amp; Philosophy</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card-text">
        <p>
          <strong>MediPortal247</strong> was conceived with a single, uncompromising vision: to create the fastest, cleanest, and most accessible movie discovery and catalogue index on the web. Finding verified download links for regional cinema, Bollywood blockbusters, Hollywood dual-audio releases, and South-dubbed gems often meant navigating through slow, confusing ad-traps.
        </p>
        <p>
          Taking direct design inspiration from legendary movie hubs like <strong>BollyFlix</strong>, <strong>VegaMovies</strong>, and <strong>Movies4u</strong>, we re-engineered the experience from the ground up: a dark cinematic UI, instant real-time search, zero page clutter, and transparent technical specifications for every film.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Key Features Grid -->
    <article class="content-card">
      <div class="card-icon-title">
        <span class="card-icon">⚡</span>
        <h2 class="card-title">What Makes MediPortal247 Different?</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="features-2col-grid">
        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feature-icon">🚀</div>
          <div class="feature-details">
            <h3>Ultra-Fast Google Drive &amp; Cloud Mirrors</h3>
            <p>Every title provides high-speed Google Drive and multi-cloud mirrors so you can download at maximum bandwidth without speed throttling.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feature-icon">🎧</div>
          <div class="feature-details">
            <h3>Dual &amp; Multi-Audio Library</h3>
            <p>Over 8,700+ titles feature Hindi-English dual audio, multi-language South dubbed tracks (Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam), and original Dolby 5.1 tracks.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feature-icon">💎</div>
          <div class="feature-details">
            <h3>Every Quality Tier Supported</h3>
            <p>From data-friendly 480p SD (300MB) for mobile screens, to 720p HD and 1080p FHD, up to breathtaking 4K UHD 2160p and space-saving 10-Bit HEVC encodes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feature-icon">💬</div>
          <div class="feature-details">
            <h3>Pre-Synced ESub &amp; MSub Subtitles</h3>
            <p>English and Hindi subtitles come embedded in MKV containers with sample screenshots provided so you can verify subtitle and video quality beforehand.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feature-icon">🔍</div>
          <div class="feature-details">
            <h3>Instant Autocomplete Search</h3>
            <p>Find any movie by actor, director, genre, or release year in less than 10 milliseconds using our pre-indexed in-memory catalogue.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feature-icon">📱</div>
          <div class="feature-details">
            <h3>Fully Mobile-Responsive Experience</h3>
            <p>Engineered for seamless one-handed browsing on smartphones, tablets, and desktop setups with a dedicated mobile slide-out drawer.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Technical Infrastructure Card -->
    <article class="content-card">
      <div class="card-icon-title">
        <span class="card-icon">🛠️</span>
        <h2 class="card-title">Architecture &amp; Data Pipeline</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card-text">
        <p>
          MediPortal247 operates on a high-concurrency Python/Flask backend backed by a multi-tier memory caching system. Rather than burdening visitors with heavy external hotlinking, over <strong>17,380+ high-resolution posters</strong> are stored and served locally with aggressive HTTP caching (<code>max-age=86400</code>).
        </p>
        <p>
          The catalogue regularly syncs with primary archive checkpoints, ensuring all download links, mirrors, and technical metadata remain fresh and accessible around the clock.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Safe Browsing & Advisory -->
    <article class="content-card highlight-card">
      <div class="card-icon-title">
