        <h2 class="card-title">Safe Browsing &amp; Recommendations</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card-text">
        <p>
          To enjoy seamless playback of dual-audio tracks and MKV subtitle streams, we strongly recommend using <strong>VLC Media Player</strong> or <strong>PotPlayer</strong> on PC, and <strong>VLC for Android</strong> or <strong>MX Player</strong> on mobile devices.
        </p>
        <p>
          Need help navigating cloud link mirrors? Visit our visual <a href="/how-to-download" class="text-link">How to Download Tutorial</a> for step-by-step instructions.
        </p>
